Exit Code: 1

Observed Failure:
[G-061: BLOCK] Task must execute on an agent/* branch. Found: HEAD

Classification:
Harness / CI execution-context integration failure

Root Cause:
GitHub Actions checks out pull_request workflows in detached HEAD / PR merge-ref context (refs/pull/<pr>/merge).
`git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD` evaluates to 'HEAD' rather than the PR source branch.
The source branch is recorded in CI metadata as GITHUB_HEAD_REF.

Resolution:
Update guardrail branch resolution to prioritize GITHUB_HEAD_REF in pull_request contexts and GITHUB_REF_NAME in push contexts before falling back to local git commands.
Preserve G-061 BLOCK enforcement semantics without weakening branch isolation.
